title Leakage-safe training
subtitle Every learned step sits inside one sklearn Pipeline, fitted on earlier dates and scored on later ones
dir down
group split Time-based split
group pipe sklearn Pipeline
gold Gold partitions (cylinder) ~ All validated dates combined
traind Earliest 80% of dates in split ~ Training rows
testd Latest 20% of dates in split ~ Never seen during fit
num Numeric: median + scaler in pipe ~ SimpleImputer + StandardScaler
cat Categorical: mode + one-hot in pipe ~ SimpleImputer + OneHotEncoder
lr Logistic regression in pipe !accent ~ class_weight balanced for the 76/24 split
metrics metrics.json (note) ~ Accuracy, precision, recall, F1, confusion matrix
model Model .joblib (note) ~ Plus models/versions/<timestamp>/
gold -> traind
gold -> testd
traind -> num fit
traind -> cat fit
num -> lr
cat -> lr
lr -> model
testd --> metrics evaluate
lr --> metrics
